{"title":"2008 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/732fa994c96018353201d91d8a36bb7c99096f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{5^2 - 4^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"21\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2ea638268ded4de647dd219c10ddc382ed80c861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 5 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16c46b15c3c8c93a2e3aff64a383e628e11be1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{5^2 - 4^2} = \\sqrt{25 - 16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"170\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/75018088cc55ef7ae6329484680444efe6447720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/3/7434492e5674ddab6c80f7f66f01f80fbf44a619.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can remember that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are the side lengths of a right triangle. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da7fca968979ee80bb58b3b8eb09ebdac45b5c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{5^2 - 4^2} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"152\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2008 CEMC Pascal\">2008 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.mat